#==============================================================================================
#
#   tests_bigint_vectors - Expected BigInt limb and conversion results pinned from the C
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Generated by a C driver that includes upstream quickjs.c (2026-06-04) built with
#       JS_LIMB_BITS == 32: each line is one call and the exact limbs, bits or text C
#       produced. The check_* helpers are in tests_bigint. Do not edit by hand.
#
#==============================================================================================

